Democrats could make major gains in Texas because of school funding cuts.

@chucktodd: “If Texas governor goes blue, is this the stake in the heart of the voucher movement on the right?”

@JessicaTaylor: “Where I’m from in Tennessee, they passed vouchers too. And every person I know back home was opposed to it because we don’t have any private schools in the area.”

